{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfzVfFLvAwZatrxbNkA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision — DR-9001\n\nFollowing the Sales Discount SOP procedure:\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The request**\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Request ID | DR-9001 |\n| Customer | Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001) |\n| Product | NS-500 Industrial Controller |\n| Requested discount | 15.0% |\n| Requested by | Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive) |\n| Date | 2026-09-23 |\n| Basis | Contract term: Acme Master Supply Agreement |\n\n**2. Active contract**\n\nThe Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) is in force: effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. The request date (2026-09-23) falls within this period. ✓\n\n**3. Pricing exception**\n\nException EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to the Master Supply Agreement) covers:\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing\n- Product: NS-500 only\n- Maximum discount: 15% of list price\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n\nThe request date (2026-09-23) is within scope. The requested 15% discount equals the exception maximum. ✓\n\n**4. Pricing policy in force**\n\nPricing Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31) applies:\n- Enterprise Account Executives: ≤10%\n- VP Sales: >10% and ≤20%\n- Chief Revenue Officer: >20%\n\n**5. Requestor's authority**\n\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive. Under Pricing Policy 2026, her authority is 10%. The requested discount (15%) exceeds this.\n\n**6. Required approver**\n\nThe Approval Authority Matrix assigns VP Sales authority for discounts >10% and ≤20%.\n\nMichael Torres, VP Sales, is the required approver.\n\n**7. Commercial eligibility**\n\nThe pricing exception establishes eligibility: the customer may receive up to 15% on NS-500, and the request is for exactly 15%. Contractual eligibility does not, however, change employee authority: Sarah Chen cannot unilaterally approve a 15% discount because her role's authority is 10%.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": 15.0,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": 15.0,\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Acme Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025, Schedule B), effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, NS-500 only\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 10.0,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025), effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B), maximum 15% on NS-500\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2026, effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"Organization chart: Sarah Chen = Enterprise Account Executive; Michael Torres = VP Sales\",\n    \"CRM discount request DR-9001, dated 2026-09-23\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```\n\n**Summary:** Sarah Chen cannot approve this request because her authority as an Enterprise Account Executive is limited to 10%. The 15% discount is commercially eligible under the Acme contract and within the VP Sales approval band. The request requires approval by Michael Torres (VP Sales)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25206,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25206},"outpu